301
00:14:19,425 --> 00:14:22,194
-Massive study.
-What was the conclusion to that study?

302
00:14:23,233 --> 00:14:24,733
You get wetter walking.

303
00:14:25,966 --> 00:14:27,033
No [bleep].

304
00:14:28,833 --> 00:14:31,099
I'm glad that study was so massive.

305
00:14:31,233 --> 00:14:34,233
That felt like that could have been
a study of two people.

306
00:14:34,366 --> 00:14:36,133
-Okay, it's raining outside.
